# osu! API v2 credentials.
#
# Only needed for DEVELOPMENT and CI: the diffcalc accuracy gate compares our
# difficulty attributes against the official
# POST /api/v2/beatmaps/{id}/attributes endpoint. The shipped tool works fully
# offline — beatmaps resolve from your local Songs\ folder by MD5.
#
# Register an OAuth application at https://osu.ppy.sh/home/account/edit
# ("OAuth" section). The client_credentials grant is sufficient; you do not need
# a browser redirect flow.
#
# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in your own values.
# Never commit real credentials. If one leaks, regenerate the secret at the URL
# above — a leaked secret stays valid until you do.

OSU_CLIENT_ID=
OSU_CLIENT_SECRET=
